Razer Pro Type Ultra (Wired 1532:0277, Wireless 1532:027B)

From https://github.com/openrazer/openrazer/pull/2888 by iacoviola (head
0091debab37f9a25474585dc70931f0c1263aec5), open upstream since 2026-08-17 and
tested there on the keyboard itself.  Rebased onto master 477f4d6, where the
Blade 18 (2026) had taken the same spot in two lists.  Only the driver and
daemon files the generators read are kept; the README, udev, appstream and
fake-driver hunks are left out.

Delete this file once upstream master carries the pull request.

